```spl
`SOC Lab Detection Rule`
`Rule Name: Windows New User Account Creation`
`Event ID: 4720 (A user account was created)`
`MITRE ATT&CK: T1136.001 (Create Account: Local Account)`
`Severity: Medium (Requires verification against change management tickets)`
`Data Source: WinEventLog:Security | index=blue`
`Description: Identifies when a new local or domain user account is provisioned, displaying the creator and created account.`
```

index=blue EventCode=4720
| eval Created_Account=coalesce(TargetUserName,Target_Account_Name)
| eval Actor=coalesce(SubjectUserName,Subject_Account_Name,user)
| table _time host Actor Created_Account SubjectDomainName Message
| sort - _time
